# Emby Integration for Bell On Demand Family Jr Archive

This folder contains the Emby media-server integration for the Bell Family Jr archive.

## Contents

- `config/`: configuration files for the Emby library setup
- `plugins/`: optional Emby plugins and compatibility modules
- `metadata/`: metadata for the archive library and shows

## Setup

These files are intended to be copied into `/opt/emby` on the target Arris device when the USB installer runs.

The Bell Family Jr archive uses Emby as the media-server backend for the historical library.
